A number of technical limitations were observed during the experiments. Some of these limitations are device-speciﬁc but they can provide recommendations for other devices designed for warehousing applications:
(1) The distance to read a barcode or QR Code depends on the size of the printed code but also on its quality. As a result, big codes were attached to items.
(2) The view is not central since the screen is at the top right ﬁeld of view. This proved to be a diﬃculty for several users since it is not optimal for the comfort.

