5. KEY FINDINGS
In this section, we summarise our ﬁndings from the interviews and the experimental study.
5.1 Potential Beneﬁts
The beneﬁts from using augmented reality in warehousing via the usage of wearable technologies like glasses depend signiﬁcantly on the hardware and results can vary a lot between devices with diﬀerent speciﬁcations. The beneﬁts proposed here do not take into account the technological barriers (which are discussed in the next section). Table 5 presents potential beneﬁts of the technology identiﬁed via this study. For each beneﬁt, the table also presents some reasons mentioned by the practitioners, lab testers or operators to justify their opinion.
